    {
      "index": 6,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "content": {
        "en": "No need to thank me. I’m just glad you’re okay. I’m Veris, from Wenqiu City.",
        "zh": "不用客气，你没事就好。我是何以真，来自纹秋市。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 11,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "content": {
        "en": "Huh? Oh—an in-flight meal! Really? Thank you so much!",
        "zh": "啊？啊啊！是飞机餐！真的吗？太感谢你了！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 8,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_闭眼",
      "content": {
        "en": "Whew~ I’m alive again! I was in such a rush to catch the flight that I didn’t have time to eat. By the time I realized, I was already too hungry to think straight.",
        "zh": "呼~活过来了！之前为了赶飞机没来得及吃东西，回过神来的时候就已经饿的神志不清了。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 9,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "content": {
        "en": "Ah! I’m so sorry! I was so focused on eating that I completely ignored you! ",
        "zh": "啊！不好意思啊！刚才只顾着吃，把你晾在一边了！我是芸台金兰观的周书，非常感谢你的搭救！可以请教你的姓名吗？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 10,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "content": {
        "en": "I’m Page from Jinlan Temple in Yuntai. Thank you so much for saving me! May I ask your name?",
        "zh": "啊！不好意思啊！刚才只顾着吃，把你晾在一边了！我是芸台金兰观的周书，非常感谢你的搭救！可以请教你的姓名吗？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 6,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
