        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "content": {
        "en": "I see. I’m not very familiar with the local culture in Yuntai. Are there many Taoist temples like that here?",
        "zh": "原来如此，我对芸台的本地文化不太了解，这里有很多这样的道观吗？",
        "ja": ""
      },
