        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "content": {
        "en": "Not at all~ Honestly, ever since I can remember, hardly anyone visits the temple.",
        "zh": "没有啦~其实从我记事起，道观就一直没多少人来。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 18,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "content": {
        "en": "Shifu says it’s because of... cultural shift, or something like that… Anyway, hardly any young people worship the Double Stars nowadays. I guess the temple’s kind of in decline.",
        "zh": "师父说这是因为什么......文化偏移，还是什么东西......反正现在年轻人里拜双星的人根本没几个，道观其实也算是没落了吧。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 19,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "content": {
        "en": "I see…",
        "zh": "这样啊...",
        "ja": ""
