      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "content": {
        "en": "Ah! But don’t worry—no matter how run-down it gets, we won’t be shutting down! It’s still a historical site, after all! My Shifu was even considering raising the ticket price. I think bumping it to ten yuan would fix everything!",
        "zh": "啊！不用担心啦，再怎么落魄也不会倒闭的，怎么着也算是历史古迹呢！师父之前也在考虑提高门票的事，我觉得涨到10块就能解决问题了！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 21,
      "choices": [],
