      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_闭眼",
      "content": {
        "en": "Ah, sorry! I’ve been rambling about all sorts of stuff! Honestly, most of the time I just handle random chores like ticketing and maintenance!",
        "zh": "啊不好意思！一直跟你唠叨乱七八糟的东西！其实大部分时间还是在做收门票一类的杂活啦！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 29,
      "choices": [],
