        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "content": {
        "en": "Since I can’t remember much history, I’m no good as a tour guide. Even though I’m technically the senior disciple in the temple, I spend most of my days running errands and hauling things around...",
        "zh": "因为我记不住什么历史，所以没法给游客当导游。结果明明我算是观内弟子里辈分最大的，却基本上每天都在做杂活，还有当苦力搬东西......",
        "ja": ""
      },
